# MVP
- User can create an account, login, create servers, join servers, and interact with their joined servers.
- The creator of a server:
    - Becomes the admin (who in a later version will have special privledges)
    - Names the server
    - Gives the names of the rest of the users
- After the server is created
    - Members can copy the join link
    - Non-members acessing the join link can pick from any unclaimed name to join as

- When a user logs in and joins a server they can:
    - Chat in the server group chat
    - Chat with their secret santa (whos identity is hidden)
    - Chat with their giftee (they can see the giftee's identity but not vice-versa)

